title: A regular expression that does not compile says so in the bar, matches nothing, and a replace-all with it changes no file
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\AAlpha beta alpha BETA\na\.b a\*b a\+b \(x\) \[y\] a\.b\nfoo foofoo food\n

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
tool edit
edit words.txt 1 1
find-option regex on
find (
wait 300
mark open-paren
wait 450
find replace-all zzz
wait 500
mark nothing-replaced
wait 450
find [
wait 300
mark open-bracket
wait 450
find replace-all zzz
wait 500
find-option regex off
find (x)
wait 300
mark literal-again
wait 450
find close
key save
wait 800
quit
